ABOUT EXCEL
Excel is an established earthmoving, excavation and civil works business in Sydney. Our civil projects entail road and drainage works, underpinning, shotcreting, shoring, concreting, bulk and detail excavation.
Our experienced site teams offer our clients comprehensive management from a safety, quality and environmental perspective.
ABOUT YOUR ROLE 
Due to an increasing workload we are seeking a Civil Engineer to join our team who will work with our experienced site teams.
Your duties will include:
- Working closely with site teams to deliver projects
- Ensure Quality, Safety and Environmental aspects are adhered to;
- Reading and interpreting civil drawings;
- Involvement in updating and understanding project programming;
- Assisting in the preparation of all incoming and outgoing project documentation and commercial aspects where required. 
REQUIREMENTS
The successful candidate must have:
- 1-2 years experience;
- Excellent communication skills, both verbally and written;
- Competent IT skills using Microsoft Word, Excel and Project;
- The ability to work within a team as well as independently;
- Ability to work under pressure and meet deadlines;
- Highly organised, with excellent attention to detail.
We are a family orientated Company and we take pride in providing a great working environment for our team. This is a full-time position. Our policy is to offer and provide career building through enhancement coupled with long term employment. Remuneration commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered to the right candidate.
If you think this role would suit you, please forward a copy of your resume.
